    "iCloud can't save this until the CloudKit schema is deployed. In CloudKit Console, open iCloud.com.tocnet.FList, then choose Deploy Schema Changes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud can't save this until the CloudKit schema is deployed. In CloudKit Console, open iCloud.com.tocnet.FList, then choose Deploy Schema Changes."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "אי אפשר לשמור את זה ב-iCloud עד שפורסים את סכמת CloudKit. ב-CloudKit Console פתחו את iCloud.com.tocnet.FList ואז Deploy Schema Changes."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud не сможет сохранить это, пока схема CloudKit не опубликована. В CloudKit Console откройте iCloud.com.tocnet.FList и выберите Deploy Schema Changes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud is restricted on this device. You can still keep a local list." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
